{
  "kind": "passage",
  "items": [
    {
      "passage_id": "P-ZPZ-YONGSHEN",
      "book_id": "ZIPING-ZHENQUAN",
      "chapter_id": "ZIPING-ZHENQUAN-05",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_layer": "classical_original",
      "classical_original": {
        "text": "八字用神,专求月令,以日干配月令地支,而生克不同,格局分焉。",
        "verification": "verified",
        "locator": "《子平真诠》论用神(通行本句读从排印本;既有 E-ZPZ-101..130 共 30 条 evidence 锚定此句)"
      },
      "commentary_layers": [],
      "paraphrase": {
        "text": "取格以月令提纲为纲:用神专于月令中求取,以日干配月令地支,生克关系不同则格局分焉。",
        "locator": ""
      },
      "source_reference": "《子平真诠》论用神(通行本句读从排印本;既有 E-ZPZ-101..130 共 30 条 evidence 锚定此句)",
      "edition": "通行本",
      "edition_id": "EDITION-ZIPING-ZHENQUAN-XULEWU",
      "edition_note": "原典层沈正文为通行本与徐乐吾评注本共同正文,本句锚定固化版本原典层;徐注评注层未逐字核验,不作正文来源",
      "verification_status": "verified",
      "status": "validated",
      "principle_ids": [
        "PRINCIPLE-MONTH-PIVOT",
        "PRINCIPLE-YONGSHEN-YUELING",
        "PRINCIPLE-TOUGAN-TONGGEN"
      ],
      "concept_ids": [
        "格局",
        "透干",
        "用神"
      ]
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "P-SMTH-SHIZI",
      "book_id": "SANMING-TONGHUI",
      "chapter_id": "SANMING-TONGHUI-06",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_layer": "classical_original",
      "classical_original": {
        "text": "若子时,则上半时在夜半前,属昨日;下半时在夜半后,属今日。亦犹冬至得十一月中气,一阳来复,为天道之初耳。",
        "verification": "cross_verified",
        "locator": "《三命通会》卷二·论时刻(P0-15 BAZI-001,classical_verbatim_multi,多源+古籍镜像核验)"
      },
      "commentary_layers": [],
      "paraphrase": {
        "text": "子时以夜半(子正)为界:上半时(晚子时,夜半前)属昨日,下半时(早子时,夜半后)属今日——日界=子正。",
        "locator": ""
      },
      "source_reference": "《三命通会》卷二·论时刻(P0-15 BAZI-001,classical_verbatim_multi,多源+古籍镜像核验)",
      "edition": "通行本(十二卷)",
      "edition_id": "EDITION-SANMING-TONGHUI-SHIERJUAN",
      "verification_status": "cross_verified",
      "status": "validated",
      "principle_ids": [
        "GOV-001",
        "PRINCIPLE-ZIZHENG-DAY"
      ],
      "concept_ids": []
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "P-YHZP-DAYUN",
      "book_id": "YUANHAI-ZIPING",
      "chapter_id": "YUANHAI-ZIPING-03",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_layer": "classical_original",
      "classical_original": {
        "text": "如正月初一子时生,上四刻仍作上年十二月,夜子时生下四刻方作正月初一子时推正,谓神仙难断夜子时。",
        "verification": "cross_verified",
        "locator": "《渊海子平》卷一·论起大运法 眉批(P0-15 BAZI-002,classical_verbatim_multi;眉批为通行本附注,多源一致)"
      },
      "commentary_layers": [],
      "paraphrase": {
        "text": "子时上四刻(23:00-24:00)=前一日/前一月;下四刻(00:00-01:00)=新日/新月。命理日界(且月界)=子正;点名「夜子时」属昨日。",
        "locator": ""
      },
      "source_reference": "《渊海子平》卷一·论起大运法 眉批(P0-15 BAZI-002,classical_verbatim_multi;眉批为通行本附注,多源一致)",
      "edition": "通行本",
      "edition_id": "EDITION-YUANHAI-ZIPING-ZENGBU",
      "verification_status": "cross_verified",
      "status": "validated",
      "principle_ids": [
        "GOV-001",
        "PRINCIPLE-ZIZHENG-DAY",
        "PRINCIPLE-YEZI-S2"
      ],
      "concept_ids": []
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "P-DTS-SHENGSHI",
      "book_id": "DITIANSUI",
      "chapter_id": "DITIANSUI-02",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_layer": "classical_original",
      "classical_original": {
        "text": "生时乃归宿之地,譬之墓也,人元为用事之神,墓之定方也,不可以不辨。",
        "verification": "cross_verified",
        "locator": "《滴天髓》通神论·生时(第十六章)(P0-15 BAZI-003,classical_verbatim_multi,维基文库/ctext/图书馆多源核验)"
      },
      "commentary_layers": [],
      "paraphrase": {
        "text": "生时(时柱)为日主归宿,以人元(支藏干)定其用事。原注:子时前三分壬水用事、后七分癸水用事;任注:前三刻为亥中余气,即夜子时。晚子时在气机层面属前日。",
        "locator": ""
      },
      "source_reference": "《滴天髓》通神论·生时(第十六章)(P0-15 BAZI-003,classical_verbatim_multi,维基文库/ctext/图书馆多源核验)",
      "edition": "通行本(任铁樵《滴天髓阐微》)",
      "edition_id": "EDITION-DITIANSUI-RENTIEQIAO",
      "verification_status": "cross_verified",
      "status": "validated",
      "principle_ids": [
        "GOV-001",
        "PRINCIPLE-ZIZHENG-DAY"
      ],
      "concept_ids": []
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "P-YHZP-WUSHUDUN",
      "book_id": "YUANHAI-ZIPING",
      "chapter_id": "YUANHAI-ZIPING-04",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_layer": "classical_original",
      "classical_original": {
        "text": "甲己还加甲,乙庚丙作初,丙辛从戊起,丁壬庚子居,戊癸何方发?壬子是真途。",
        "verification": "cross_verified",
        "locator": "《渊海子平》卷一·论日上起时例(P0-15 BAZI-004,classical_verbatim_multi,高度通行多源一致)"
      },
      "commentary_layers": [],
      "paraphrase": {
        "text": "五鼠遁起时诀:日干定子时天干,依次遁十二时柱;时柱天干由日干推导。",
        "locator": ""
      },
      "source_reference": "《渊海子平》卷一·论日上起时例(P0-15 BAZI-004,classical_verbatim_multi,高度通行多源一致)",
      "edition": "通行本",
      "edition_id": "EDITION-YUANHAI-ZIPING-ZENGBU",
      "verification_status": "cross_verified",
      "status": "validated",
      "principle_ids": [
        "PRINCIPLE-WUSHUDUN"
      ],
      "concept_ids": [
        "透干"
      ]
    },
